From 3276910f6323f7bf6a1247fd2c8ea3925f58dca0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Michael \"ASAP\" Weinrich" <michael@a5ap.net>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 18:35:46 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] st/oxr: add XR_EXT_frame_synthesis plumbing

Validate XrFrameSynthesisInfoEXT chained to projection views and forward
the motion vector and depth swapchains, together with scale/offset,
appSpaceDeltaPose, the layer space pose and the depth range, through a new
optional xrt_compositor::layer_frame_synthesis call that attaches the data
to the last submitted projection layer.

The data travels through the Vulkan client compositor, IPC and the
multi compositor, and is accumulated by comp_base. Compositors that do
not implement the call drop the data. XrFrameSynthesisConfigViewEXT
recommends the color resolution.

The extension is behind XRT_FEATURE_OPENXR_FRAME_SYNTHESIS (default OFF)
as the main compositor does not consume the data.
